{"slug":"Animal-Hospital-(Anomaly)-Snowy-Hub-Animal-Hospital-Auto-Work-Auto-Heal-More-239745","_id":"6a406249aa6d301d9de323b0","title":"Snowy Hub | Animal Hospital, Auto Work, Auto Heal & More","game":{"_id":"6a373aa38bf74976ed4352a4","gameId":78515283254292,"name":"Animal Hospital (Anomaly) 🧪","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":78515283254292},"features":"📋 1. Core Automation Suite\nAuto Check-In / Reception:\nScans the workspace for reception desks, call bells, clipboards, shutters, and intake prompts.\nAutomatically rotates your camera and character toward the counter and performs authentic 1.5s - 2.0s key-holds on the E key to check in arriving patients.\nAuto-Heal / Treat Patients:\nScans patient models on beds and examination tables.\nAutomatically detects their specific ailment (e.g., Headache, Fever, Bleeding, Broken Bone, Infection).\nEquips the exact matching medical tool from your inventory (Herbs, Thermometer, Bandage, Splint, Antibiotics, etc.) and administers treatment.\nAuto-Use Machines:\nIdentifies diagnostic equipment, lab scanners, x-rays, analyzers, and computers.\nAutomatically interacts with and runs diagnostic tests when required.\nAuto-Interact (ALL Prompts):\nGlobal dynamic scanner that activates every proximity prompt and click detector in range without needing static model paths.\n☕ 2. Sanity Protection & Coffee Loop\nServer-Verified Sanity Protection:\nTracks real server-authoritative sanity levels to prevent client-side desync or rubberbanding.\n200s Timed Coffee TP Brew Loop:\nSynchronized with the game's ~200-second coffee brewing timer.\nWhen sanity dips below 75% or when coffee finishes brewing (~195s–200s), it saves your exact coordinates, teleports to the Coffee Machine, aims camera, grabs fresh coffee, equips and drinks it, and immediately teleports back to your previous location.\n🛡️ 3. Combat & Threat Defense\nAuto-Taser & Weapon Defense:\nScans for hostility anomalies and monster models (Skinwalkers, Stalkers, Hiders, Head Bangers, Tendrils).\nAutomatically equips your Taser or Gun and attacks hostiles upon detection.\nAuto Feed Bed Monster:\nAutomatically equips Maple Syrup and treats bed monster anomalies under cots before they attack.\n👁️ 4. Visuals & ESP\nPatient / Animal ESP: Highlights all sick patients and animals in Green through walls with their name and active ailment.\nAnomaly / Monster ESP: Highlights all hostile entities and threats in Red (!! Monster Name) through walls.\nUniversal ESP: Highlights tools, inventory items, and other players.\n⚡ 5. Movement & Utilities (Universal)\nCustom WalkSpeed & JumpPower (adjustable sliders).\nNoclip (walk through walls/doors).\nAnti-AFK (prevents idle kick).\nAuto Game Detection: Instantly loads this entire suite whenever you join Animal Hospital.","tags":["auto check in","auto heal","auto taser","Animal Hospital","auto work"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://flowauth.net/v1/ui/a87f00d9adf63658655fcd02ab86a4ef.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","username":"snowy","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1fd7e4f7db7454970708a731adacc16dd1984da51d25268d0bfee1e88b6e4d74.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696ff36b3593559f36ddb741-1789861822395.png"},"lvl":23,"status":"offline","id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":2,"period":"all","metric":"likes","value":1986}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":1000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1fd7e4f7db7454970708a731adacc16dd1984da51d25268d0bfee1e88b6e4d74.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696ff36b3593559f36ddb741-1789861822395.png"}},"verified":true,"discord":"https://discord.gg/getsnowy","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/getsnowy","views":31496,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibili